{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pantry Raid is a rogue lite dungeon-crawler with cooking elements. Players traverse the pantry, defeating food-themed enemies to make meals to improve your character during the course of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-energy combat where quick reflexes and sharp strategy are key. With dynamic enemies, fluid movement, and ever-changing buff combinations, every battle is a thrilling test of skill. Dodge, strike, and adapt in the heat of the pantry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized levels and dynamic buff combinations, ensuring no two playthroughs are ever the same. Adapt to shifting strategies as new buffs reshape your play-style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each buff ties to a flavorful element\u2014like Spicy for fire attacks or Salty for ice defenses\u2014leading to unexpected synergies. Adapt, experiment, and master these dynamic power-ups to dominate the pantry!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An adorable crew of cooking critters! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Save Moth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582510/6bd74cc76b8a847eb67f190d07ddb422c7d56a64.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Learner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582510/a2c8f827891ee71dc02dd96826f7fbca4654685c.jpg"},{"name":"Invincible","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582510/bffd9e2d3985394329c9563d615b13c8a89ba7c3.jpg"},{"name":"Low-Carb Diet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582510/832e00ebf4a6b1ce554ac2c35dfec05606f20871.jpg"},{"name":"Investor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582510/f69d562d87